Package: depprep
Title: Dependence-Aware Preprocessing for Multivariate Exploratory
    Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Gustavo", "Fonseca", , "gfonseca@unifesp.br", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Preprocessing that corrects spatial, temporal and
    spatio-temporal autocorrelation in data sets with many variables of
    different dependence regimes, while preserving the correlations
    between variables. Variables with similar dependence signatures share
    a common basis, and the corrected matrix is intended for PCA, MDS,
    k-means and self-organizing maps.
